  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal: To save lives through improved food and nutrition status of children being boys and girls and pregnant and lactating women whilst restoring livelihoods and enhancing communities resilience to shocks amongst the vulnerable Internally Displaced Persons, refugees and host population in South Kordofan.
 
 WVUK have a 4.0047% share of this project, alongside the following SOs: Canada, Germany, Ireland, Italy, Korea, New Zealand, Switzerland and the US.</narrative>
